  "goodToKnow": "Der Mechanismus is a mechanism, both physical (der Mechanismus eines Schlosses) and abstract: Abwehrmechanismus (defence mechanism), Kontrollmechanismus. The EU has many: der Rettungsmechanismus, der Rechtsstaatsmechanismus. Die Mechanik is mechanics, and der Mechaniker (or Kfz-Mechatroniker today) is a mechanic. Germany's tradition of precision clockwork includes the watchmaking town of Glashütte. Plural: die Mechanismen."
